lm è il sequel di Tokyo Ghoul, un film del 2017, che a sua volta è basato sulla serie manga Tokyo Ghoul, da cui hanno tratto anche un anime.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Mangiare o essere mangiato","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2019-07-19","status":"Released","rating":6.5,"ratingCount":100,"genres":["Azione","Horror","Fantascienza","Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"101m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1087773,"name":"Masataka Kubota","role":"Ken Kaneki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xhRRlTTC4K12TO6FjYaX9PEEYka.jpg"},{"id":84044,"name":"Shota Matsuda","role":"Shū Tsukiyama","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1fPZ4JY1Zh4gROMFRhs4d5mOgyO.jpg"},{"id":1446601,"name":"Maika Yamamoto","role":"Toka Kirishima","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tMZ230XFpBKZXvy4aChYwMHp8dA.jpg"},{"id":225039,"name":"Shunya Shiraishi","role":"Nishiki Nishio","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m2KYJ6DLItCvLjN8PAcPmqVfC29.jpg"},{"id":1946101,"name":"Kai Ogasawara","role":"Hideyoshi Nagachika","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qj4q7MYsQeEzxjDpiARASG1sKng.jpg"},{"id":1401338,"name":"Hiyori Sakurada","role":"Hinami Fueguchi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/62ZKkbRas0oecXFcuIyzuKlom62.jpg"},{"id":1202404,"name":"Nobuyuki Suzuki","role":"Kotaro Amon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xtqy7WCwD9QFFfaZCbB2nsokbZS.jpg"},{"id":1841387,"name":"Minosuke Bando","role":"Uta","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zVIHl0H5Vf9IJH8nZXIAu5VIXJk.jpg"},{"id":240009,"name":"Kunio Murai","role":"Kuzen Yoshimura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqtVi31xDD3M9N6pg2vbgUrvpsQ.jpg"},{"id":1574954,"name":"Shuntaro Yanagi","role":"Renji Yomo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z9sPHsSAxpKFt0s4QyTdLepT3qB.jpg"},{"id":2109360,"name":"Nana Mori","role":"Yoriko Kosaka","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92cSvqzUVbancmqFmtfgdIVBh6s.jpg"},{"id":2092978,"name":"Mai Kiryu","role":"Kimi Nishino","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2NsaouRvBljwKh0XWhbhfJ5T41V.jpg"},{"id":1122535,"name":"Jiyoung","role":"Itori","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g2YR8OptFh60RAuuXJrM5HD7YE8.jpg"},{"id":3671677,"name":"Maggy","role":"Marguerite","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ycSptLMAcrFngmaLFzkgXH9qt7L.jpg"},{"id":1566805,"name":"Mackenyu Maeda","role":"Souta","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4L3HRO6FGpCT20AnEgkr9OoamJK.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Tokyo Ghoul 'S'","overview":"Ken Kaneki, trasformato in ghoul in seguito a un misterioso incidente, si è unito all'Anteiku, un bar che raccoglie alcuni ghoul che cercano un rapporto meno predatorio col mondo umano. Ma il caos tornerà a inseguirlo attraverso l'interesse di Shuu Tsukiyama, un potente ghoul noto come Gourmet, ossessionato alla ricerca di nuovi sapori e quindi interessato a divorare Kaneki.  Il film è il sequel di Tokyo Ghoul, un film del 2017, che a sua volta è basato sulla serie manga Tokyo Ghoul, da cui hanno tratto anche un anime.","tagline":"Mangiare o essere mangiato"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Tokyo Ghoul 'S'","overview":"Now a member of Anteiku, Ken Kaneki grows closer to the ghouls around him. Determined to protect his new home against anti-ghoul forces, he trains his powers in secret. But when the infamous gourmet, Shū Tsukiyama, wishes to savour some half-ghoul flavour, Kaneki's training is put to test of a lifetime.","tagline":"To eat or to be eaten"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"東京喰種 トーキョーグール【S】","overview":"不慮の事故で人肉を食べる“喰種”と人間の中間の“半喰種”になってしまった金木は、董香たちとともに喰種が集う喫茶店“あんていく”でささやかだが幸せな日々を送っていた。そこへ美食家（グルメ）と呼ばれる喰種、月山が出現。厄介だから近づくなと董香に言われる金木だったが、月山と次第に距離を縮めていく。金木は月山に秘密の“喰種レストラン”に招待されて行くが、そこで月山は隠していた正体を見せ、金木に襲い掛かる。","tagline":"喰うか。喰われるか。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.